However, Madison Cawthorn lost his Republican
primary months ago and is being removed after

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:41.289
just one term.

00:00:41.289 --> 00:00:46.309
Lauren Boebert is number three and indeed
she may lose when we go and take a look at

00:00:46.309 --> 00:00:51.890
Colorado and we look at that third district,
you will see that as of this moment.

