really clear the crowd believed it.

00:02:37.099 --> 00:02:39.140
Speaker 2: But I am so optimistic.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:42.519
Yeah, it is absolutely trending in our favor.

00:02:42.519 --> 00:02:48.930
As Ben has told you, The New York Times is
still saying Congresswoman Lauren Boebert

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:51.660
